/**
 * ResQplan Calibrated Command Surface — authority, organization, volunteer, and responder workstreams.
 * Preserve the existing editorial civic-institutional identity: lifecycle rail, mineral-white evidence fields,
 * deep navy framing, sea-glass teal verification, and sparing emergency accents. Every major interaction updates
 * the shared demo state so the application reads as one connected Smart India Hackathon demonstration.
 */
